Subject: Re: [stan-users] About the Riemannian geometry in Stan
Message-ID: <Qy4EqYdGzM8.zeeJxwkFDgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <Qy4EqYdGzM8.v1Bf1Jv7DQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <Qy4EqYdGzM8.ezTcNHFyDQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com> <Qy4EqYdGzM8.v1Bf1Jv7DQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
