Subject: scaling parameters & divergent transitions
Message-ID: <Du2vwAI5UD0.-jGcZTxzAAAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/Du2vwAI5UD0/m/-jGcZTxzAAAJ>
