From: u8c4f70ab584cd6d9 at groups.google.com (John Hall)
Date: Tue, 11 Apr 2017 22:16:01 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-users] Explicitly Correlated Parameters
Message-ID: <Zuz9CHJ0aSU.LQnJx4h0AQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <Zuz9CHJ0aSU.Dt3LaFwmAQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <Zuz9CHJ0aSU.D-uoqKcXCQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com> <Zuz9CHJ0aSU.Dt3LaFwmAQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
