Subject: Re: [stan-users] Bypassing autodiff?
Message-ID: <2eVrJh5MKEI.yL7YUH9CAwAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <2eVrJh5MKEI.WeFNZLw4AwAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <2eVrJh5MKEI.Dnnz2mgcAwAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com> <2eVrJh5MKEI.WeFNZLw4AwAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
