> On Apr 20, 2017, at 1:19 PM, Glenn Goldsmith <glenn.g...@gmail.com> wrote:
>
> Just a quick update to let you know that I've now got the custom autodiff working, and that it has indeed brought the size of the overall expression graph down to a totally manageable level.
>
