                data = data.info <http://data.info>,
                init = rep(inits.info1, 3),
                chains = 3,
                iter =110000,
                warmup = 10000,
                control=list(adapt_delta=0.95),
                thin = 1,
                verbose = FALSE,
                open_progress = FALSE,
                refresh = 1000
                )

Thanks for your time and consideration.

