Here it's telling you that within the "transformed parameters" block the validation failed.

One particular value isn't obeying the constraints you set.

Here, we can clearly see this message doesn't belong to the core snippet provided. The message is showing that the variable prob is actually an array or vector (or row vector). In the snippet provided, it's declared as a scalar.

I think you need to look at the definition of prob and you'll need to construct it such that the values satisfy the constraints for all valid values of whatever terms go into it.

