On 23 April 2017 at 01:59, Daniel Lee <bea...@alum.mit.edu> wrote:

>
>
> On Apr 22, 2017, at 9:47 AM, Glenn Goldsmith <glenn.g...@gmail.com> wrote:
>
> > Thanks Bob, I'll take a look at the normal_lpdf and see how I go.
